                                "sense_id": "f4fb3e70-b944-3341-bd76-ca26c43fd54c",
                                "text": "We build our houses on the sand Comely withoutside and within; 20 But when the winds and rains begin To beat on them, they cannot stand; They perish, quickly overthrown, Loose from the very basement stone."
