                                "sense_id": "f4fb3e70-b944-3341-bd76-ca26c43fd54c",
                                "text": "At noon, he got withoutside of the reef by a second opening more to the north; for, having observed the latitude to be 22 deg. 17', his intention was to seek for the River of Jacob Remessens (near the North-west Cape); but the wind veering to north-east, he could no longer follow the direction of the coast."
